BT
(Article 3\(1\). A family member includes the foreigner's spouse.) Tj
ET
%%Page: 41 41
BT
(Article 41. The sponsor holds a residence permit valid for not less than one year with the possibility of renewal. Family members shall normally be outside Albania. The sponsor proves suitable housing, sickness insurance, and stable and regular resources.) Tj
ET
%%Page: 68 68
BT
(Article 68. A digital mobile worker lawfully staying in Albania may receive an initial permit for not more than one year. The applicant has a foreign employment contract or a foreign service contract, proof of accommodation, health insurance valid for at least one year, and criminal-record certificates from the country of origin and country of residence.) Tj
ET
